# RefactorGPT Tools – Cursor rules

Project: Ruby CLI tools for refactoring (refactor_gpt.rb), code search (ag_gpt.rb), bash generation (bash_gpt.rb), Q&A (ask_gpt.rb), git commit (git_commit_gpt.rb), superagent TUI (superagent.rb). Shared code in lib/ (openai_client, gemini_client, llm_router for model→backend routing); superagent in lib/superagent/. Config: .env with MODEL, TECHNICAL_MODEL, IMAGE_MODEL; backend from model name. Tests in test/.
